  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes an 8‑qubit variational quantum machine‑learning model (AQEN) for fraud detection and reports 94.7% accuracy and AUC 0.951 on a ~5,000‑transaction dataset, compared to 93.5% accuracy and AUC 0.923 for XGBoost. Experiments are performed on Qiskit Aer with an IBMQ Lima noise model (circuit depth 47, 7 CNOTs). Improvements are modest (~1.2% accuracy) and demonstrated only in simulation.",
